sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant App
  participant ZKTeco
  participant HRM
  User->>App: Enter ZKTeco URL once
  App->>ZKTeco: GET /api/v1/mobile/app-config
  ZKTeco-->>App: endpoints + feature flags
  User->>App: Login
  App->>HRM: POST auth.login URL from config
  HRM-->>App: JWT token
  App->>ZKTeco: POST attendance.punch with employee_id
